    rss-crit:reasoning "Every protection-control property on every RailwayInformationFlow is set to its protective value (true) to construct a hypothetical best-achievable state for scenario comparison. This is not derived from the legacy workbook or from any architecture evidence; it is a deliberately idealised counterfactual used as the reference point against which single-control-degradation and other scenarios are compared."@en ;
    rss-crit:revisionConditions "Not applicable: this basis exists only to support scenario comparison and is never promoted to a case fact about the real ETCS deployment."@en .
